---
source: crates/telec-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: output
---
Show a unified diff between two exact artifact versions

Usage: telec-cli workflow artifacts diff [OPTIONS] <SLUG> <NAME> <OLD_DIGEST> <NEW_DIGEST>

Arguments:
  <SLUG>        Todo slug (unique per project)
  <NAME>        Artifact kind
  <OLD_DIGEST>  Digest of the older artifact version
  <NEW_DIGEST>  Digest of the newer artifact version

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>  Override the project context. By default the project name is derived from the current working directory's basename
  -h, --help               Print help
